<title>USA: American White Q4 oper shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>American White Q4 oper shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>DAYVILLE, Conn. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMERICAN WHITE CROSS, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>		   (In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				Quarter Ended	  Year Ended</p>
<p>			   12/31/96    12/31/95  12/31/96  12/31/95</p>
<p> Sales		     $20,711     $20,075 $87,798    $87,351</p>
<p> Net loss	    (7,845)(1)     (2,347) (29,908)(2) (4,694)</p>
<p> Net loss per share     (1.18)	(0.35) (4.48)	(0.70)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		6,676	 6,676  6,676	 6,676</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) Includes non-cash charges of $4,559 related to the Company's strategic and cost evaluation following its Chapter 11 filing and $1,053 of Chapter 11 professional fees. (2) Includes non-cash charges of $13,217 related to the Company's strategic and cost evaluation following its Chapter 11 filing, $2,147 of Chapter 11 professional fees and $5,093 related to the write-off of deferred tax assets.</p>
<p>The company's net loss, excluding non-cash charges and reorganization expenses, was $2,233,000 or $0.33 per share.</p>
</text>
